WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.303
Write your own cycle.

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:06.900
Open Program Builder. Add a week, then add a day.

00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:12.999
Add exercises from the library. Set sets, reps, and a percent of your PR.

00:00:13.433 --> 00:00:19.563
Name your program and it joins the list. Preview it, then start it.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.576
Lifting Lab is free to download. Pro unlocks this.
